"css-0 e68yk9k0"></span><img src="https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/how-to-support-in-the-fight-to-end-violence-against-women-64009970e2603.jpg?crop=1.00xw:1.00xh;0,0&amp;resize=300:*" alt title="How to support in the fight to end violence against women " width="120" height="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy" class="css-1l0uuk1 e94w1mj6"/><div class="css-1ib98um e94w1mj7"><span class="css-8lle59 e94w1mj8">How to support fight to end violence against women</span></div><span aria-hidden="true" data-theme-key="title-design-element-after" class="css-0 e68yk9k1"></span></a></li></ul></aside></section><div data-journey-blur="partial" data-ad-exclude="true" class="css-19m4yzp e1jy25xv0"><div class="css-sfzxfp ev8dhu59"><span class="css-3mrz81 ev8dhu51"><img src="https://hips.hearstapps.com/rover/profile_photos/18d8ab27-2dfd-4141-8467-f11fde1d668a_1649857158.file?fill=1:1&amp;resize=120:*" alt="Headshot of Megan Wallace" title="Headshot of Megan Wallace" width="100%" height="100%" decoding="async" loading="lazy" class="css-o0wq4v ev8dhu53"/></span><div class="css-gorqpr ev8dhu58"><span class="css-0 ev8dhu56"><a data-theme-key="base-link" href="/uk/author/232758/megan-wallace/" class="enoqepz3 css-139y3o6 e1socmtw0"><span>Megan Wallace</span></a></span><div class="css-1lwatn5 ev8dhu57">Former Sex and Relationships Editor</div></div><div class="css-1dsojn8 ev8dhu55"><div class="css-1v0sick ev8dhu54"><p>Megan Wallace (they/them) is Cosmopolitan UK’s Former Sex and Relationships Editor covering sexual pleasure, sex toys, LGBTQIA+ identity, dating and romance. They have covered sexuality and relationships for over five years and are the founder of the <a href="https://pulpzine.substack.com/">PULP zine</a>, which publishes essays on culture and sex. In their spare time, they can be found exploring the London kink scene and planning dates on Feeld.&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="piano-end-of-article-au css-mns9uv e1c8uadx3"></div></div></div><section data-lazy-id="P0-46"><div data-embed="watch-next" class="css-es6uyf e1a8voem5"><div data-journey-blur="partial" class="css-eq5es6 e1a8voem4"><div class="css-1sowyjy e1a8voem3"><span class="css-eo7tpn e1a8voem2"><span aria-hidden="true" data-theme-key="title-design-element-before" class="css-0 e68yk9k0"></span><span class="css-0 e1a8voem1">Watch Next</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-theme-key="title-design-element-after" class="css-0 e68yk9k1"></span></span><span class="css-19bdt98 e1a8voem0"> </span></div><div class="__resp-container css-1ui7hop eksj1ta0"><div class="video-player css-1v31zvn"><video playsinline style="height:100%;width:100%;"></video></div></div></div></div></section><div data-journey-unblur="true" class="gpt-breaker-container breaker-ad css-172ho3e e1spmc110"><div class="ad-disclaimer no-print css-q3d0ua e1caqep90">Advertisement - Continue Reading Below</div><div data-slot-type="breaker" id="article-marketplace-horizontal" suppressHydrationWarning class="ad-container css-11u1es3 ewg5wdb1"></div></div><div id="module-recommended" data-journey-hide="true" class="recommended-module css-bnk019 epwqfrm0"></div><div data-block="transporter" data-journey-hide="true" data-lazy-id="P0-47" class="css-15qxeah e9dgbgx0"><section class="css-s5uuky ezpcz1b0"><div data-theme-key="block-header" class="css-1707srh eqz7u0o3"><h2 data-theme-key="block-heading" class="css-16w4a2k eqz7u0o2"><span aria-hidden="true" data-theme-key="title-design-element-before" class="css-0 e68yk9k0"></span><a data-theme-key="base-link" href="/uk/love-sex/" class="css-0 e1socmtw0">Love &amp; Sex</a><span aria-hidden="true" data-theme-key="title-design-element-after" class="css-0 e68yk9k1"></span></h2></div><div data-theme-key="four-across-layout" class="css-mn2ao7 ezpcz1b1"><a data-theme-key="custom-item" label data-vars-cta="Love &amp; Sex" data-vars-ga-position="1" data-vars-ga-call-to-action="Why so many women can’t resist ‘tradwife’ porn" data-vars-ga-outbound-link="https://www.cosmopolitan.com/uk/love-sex/sex/a70799302/tradwife-porn/" data-vars-ga-ux-element="Transporter" href="/uk/love-sex/sex/a70799302/tradwife-porn/" class="ee4ms354 css-m8pdf0 e1socmtw0"><div class="css-79elbk ee4ms351"><div class="css-ftsoqv ee4ms353"><img src="https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/c977c2c1-890e-4d0f-8f48-e0cee1134581.jpg?crop=0.505xw:1.00xh;0.248xw,0&amp;resize=360:*" alt="a retrostyle television displaying three stylized figures in a colorful indoor scene" title="Housewife porn" width="100%" height="auto" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div></div><div data-theme-key="custom-item-content" class="css-oojkbc ee4ms352"><p data-theme-key="custom-item-title" class="css-cxj4ku e10ip9lg11"><span aria-hidden="true" data-theme-key="title-design-element-before" class="css-0 e68yk9k0"></span><span data-theme-key="custom-item-title-text" class="css-7ca52c e10ip9lg10">Why so many women can’t resist ‘tradwife’ porn</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-theme-key="title-design-element-after" class="css-0 e68yk9k1"></span></p></div></a><a data-theme-key="custom-item" label data-vars-cta="Love &amp; Sex" data-vars-ga-position="2" data-vars-ga-call-to-action="The unhappy couples who are too broke to break up" data-vars-ga-outbound-link="https://www.cosmopolitan.com/uk/love-sex/relationships/a66021804/unhappy-couples-cant-afford-break-up/" data-vars-ga-ux-element="Transporter" href="/uk/love-sex/relationships/a66021804/unhappy-couples-cant-afford-break-up/" class="ee4ms354 css-m8pdf0 e1socmtw0"><div class="css-79elbk ee4ms351"><div class="css-ftsoqv ee4ms353"><img src="https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/stuck-living-with-ex-cant-afford-to-move-out-679b827403abd.jpg?crop=0.426xw:0.847xh;0.574xw,0.111xh&amp;resize=360:*" alt="a torn paper house model with orange roofs symbolizing division or conflict" title="The unhappy couples who are too broke to break up" width="100%" height="auto" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div></div><div data-theme-key="custom-item-content" class="css-oojkbc ee4ms352"><p data-theme-key="custom-item-title" class="css-cxj4ku e10ip9lg11"><span aria-hidden="true" data-theme-key="title-design-element-before" class="css-0 e68yk9k0"></span><span data-theme-key="custom-item-title-text" class="css-7ca52c e10ip9lg10">The unhappy couples who are too broke to break up</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-theme-key="title-design-element-after" class="css-0 e68yk9k1"></span></p></div></a><a data-theme-key="custom-item" label data-vars-cta="Love &amp; Sex" data-vars-ga-position="3" data-vars-ga-call-to-action="Sapphic folk: fill in our sex and dating survey!" data-vars-ga-outbound-link="https://www.cosmopolitan.com/uk/love-sex/relationships/a70771919/lgbtq-sex-dating-survey/" data-vars-ga-ux-element="Transporter" href="/uk/love-sex/relationships/a70771919/lgbtq-sex-dating-survey/" class="ee4ms354 css-m8pdf0 e1socmtw0"><div class="css-79elbk ee4ms351"><div class="css-ftsoqv ee4ms353"><img src="https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/39c46506-5f90-4bb9-97b7-9e78b8f23425.jpg?crop=0.671xw:1.00xh;0.0440xw,0&amp;resize=360:*" alt="sapphic folks, we need you for our sex and dating survey" title="Sapphic folks, we need you for our sex and dating survey!" width="100%" height="auto" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div></div><div data-theme-key="custom-item-content" class="css-oojkbc ee4ms352"><p data-theme-key="custom-item-title" class="css-cxj4ku e10ip9lg11"><span aria-hidden="true" data-theme-key="title-design-element-before" class="css-0 e68yk9k0"></span><span data-theme-key="custom-item-title-text" class="css-7ca52c e10ip9lg10">Sapphic folk: fill in our sex and dating survey!</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-theme-key="title-design-element-after" class="css-0 e68yk9k1"></span></p></div></a><a data-theme-key="custom-item" label data-vars-cta="Love &amp; Sex" data-vars-ga-position="4" data-vars-ga-call-to-action="Is one-sided monogamy actually a thing?" data-vars-ga-outbound-link="https://www.cosmop